WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,800
The first layer of the Guilty Word is almost useless

2
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:03,800
I'm not guilty

3
00:00:03,800 --> 00:00:06,200
I kill all the people who deserve to die

4
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:07,400
i am a good person

5
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:08,700
My divine seal is the Dharma of the gods

6
00:00:08,700 --> 00:00:10,000
What kind of person can eat evil without mercy?

7
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:11,800
The people I killed were all bad people, are you saying that?

8
00:00:11,800 --> 00:00:13,600
It was wrong for the gods to give me the seal.

9
00:00:13,600 --> 00:00:15,100
There is no sin in my world

10
00:00:15,100 --> 00:00:16,300
Only strong or not

11
00:00:16,300 --> 00:00:18,500
The souls of these people are black and worse than the devil bow.

12
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:20,400
Lord Son of God, don’t talk nonsense to them about divine signs.

13
00:00:20,400 --> 00:00:29,150
Destroy this group of souls who are more evil than the magic bow.

14
00:00:29,150 --> 00:00:30,150
The second level effect of divine words

15
00:00:30,150 --> 00:00:31,550
Can forcibly destroy people's will

16
00:00:31,550 --> 00:00:33,150
Turn the recipient into a servant of God
